Package: vivarcdi
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Salvatore <25297596+valsar6@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-tk
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/valsar6/VivArcDi
Description: Make Vivaldi behave like Arc
 VivArcDi adds Arc-style tabs, sidebar and shortcuts to Vivaldi without
 modifying its browser engine. It patches Vivaldi's window.html, applies
 itself again after every Vivaldi update and can be removed at any time.
